            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>The Short Answer</h2>
<p>
            <strong>A Sunny Health & Fitness treadmill cost $199.99 to $2,999.99 on Sunny’s store on 27 November 2026,
            and most of its in-stock motorised folding treadmills were $399.99 to $799.99.</strong> Amazon was cheaper on
            most of the models we could match, by about $20 to $500.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Manual (no motor):</strong> $199.99 for the SF-T1407SMART on Sunny’s store; $179.88 on Amazon.</li>
            <li><strong>TreadPad walking pads:</strong> $299.99 to $599.99, depending on incline and handlebar.</li>
            <li><strong>Folding motorised treadmills:</strong> $399.99 (TP10) to $699.99 (SF-T7718 and the 20-inch
            OneClick-Fold).</li>
            <li><strong>Heavier-duty and touchscreen:</strong> $799.99 to $1,199.99, including the T10 with a touchscreen
            at $1,099.99.</li>
            <li><strong>Premium:</strong> $2,199.99 and $2,999.99 incline-decline machines and a $2,499.99 curved <a href="/best-manual-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium" data-autolink>manual
            treadmill</a>.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            For the range itself, see our <a href="/sunny-health-fitness-treadmills/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Sunny treadmill guide</a>; for prices
            across every brand, <a href="/how-much-does-a-treadmill-cost/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">how much a treadmill costs</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

